ants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"-psZLTe6IJTQUB-bZF7Zyg","review_id":"K9Id4_iNCI5d-1TnY8RLRA","date":"2014-06-23T07:26:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9535634517669678,"text_excerpt":"The little plates they give you as kind of like an amuse bouche are delicious! I was unfamiliar with most of it, there was a fried tofu that was really good and I don't like tofu at all. There was also a bean sprout dish that tasted \"kimcheed\" if that even makes sense lol. The kimchee I got the first time I visited was tame but this time it was really spicy and full of flavor. I got spicy pork and squid twice in a row, it is A+MAZING and very spicy which I love! My friend got Ddeokbokki which was new to me. The texture was unusual but perfect and the red sauce was savory and spicy. I didn't try my other friends Ramyun this time around but it was good last time. Can't wait to come back and..."},{"business_id":"-psZLTe6IJTQUB-bZF7Zyg","review_id":"Z4PoX7Hgxso0YgdxhKyhyQ","date":"2017-07-15T01:50:40","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9525316953659058,"text_excerpt":"It was my first time having Korean food and it was a great experience. I want to caution those who haven't had Korean BBQ before, it's not the only thing on the menu if you don't want to cook your meat (or non-meat) over an open-flamed grill at table. We decided to have that for our inaugural meal. Chopsticks are tricky, but the trick is not to overthink them. We ordered beef and chicken along with an array of sides to stuff romaine leaves with. I personally loved the fresh, matchstick-sized green beans with sauce and garlic, but the broccoli, kimchi, fish cakes, etc., were all good. The corn cheese is wonderful as was the meat once cooked (I tend to go overboard in the \"well done\" dept)...."},{"business_id":"-psZLTe6IJTQUB-bZF7Zyg","review_id":"2KuQiD9VtuLroPkPTHi3_Q","date":"2012-08-01T21:42:06","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9521583914756775,"text_excerpt":"Me and the DPIC came here last night, as we've been craving Korean, but Korea House makes us feel a little out of sorts, so I was super excited when I heard of this place! Anyway, I love Korean, and this really hits the spot. It's great that they let you grill the short ribs by the table, but it can get somewhat crowded with all the side dishes they give you. Kimchi was good. Regular kimchi was somewhat spicy, but nice. The potato kimchi was my favorite. We had a rice bowl, which was good, but not amazing, and the LA Kalbi. Kalbi was good, but the meat was somewhat sinewy. I definitely ate all of it, though. The Chili/soybean paste was to die for as well as the sesame oil dressing. It's n..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"-psZLTe6IJTQUB-bZF7Zyg","photo_id":"FS83T-JdUmjl2GTjLmMkIw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/FS83T-JdUmjl2GTjLmMkIw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9264532923698425},{"business_id":"-psZLTe6IJTQUB-bZF7Zyg","photo_id":"B8bG5oPTsrzPRzeBIIbeTg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/B8bG5oPTsrzPRzeBIIbeTg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9232801198959351},{"business_id":"-psZLTe6IJTQUB-bZF7Zyg","photo_id":"x4Za9ZFL4F38B3AWkzfZ7A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/x4Za9ZFL4F38B3AWkzfZ7A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9090470671653748},{"business_id":"-psZLTe6IJTQUB-bZF7Zyg","photo_id":"zgUiHi6P3uY_ny7eRK_36g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/zgUiHi6P3uY_ny7eRK_36g.jpg","v